(3232720, 450923, 69387, '<td valign="top">Hilarious! Terrific subject, I can relate :) A bit too dark around the sides, especially on the left.</td>', 'Hilarious! Terrific subject, I can relate :) A bit too dark around the sides, especially on the left.', '2007-01-15 00:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232721, 451648, 62637, '<td valign="top">Where to start?  First, while I''m sure the blur is intentional, it does nothing for me.  Whatever detail isn''t removed by the motion blur is further obscured by the swath of chroma noise (all the blue stuff that is randomly distributed everywhere) that is this image''s most dominant feature.  Finally...demestic?  You should look into installing the <a href="//www.mozilla.com/en-US/firefox/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Firefox 2.0 web browser</a>.  Its built in spell checker will never leave you spelling dOmestic wrong again!<br/> <br/>So, in summary, I''m giving you a 1.  Feel free to PM me (even during voting, I don''t really care) and I''ll gladly give you some pointers to remedy these mistakes for next time!</td>', 'Where to start?  First, while I''m sure the blur is intentional, it does nothing for me.  Whatever detail isn''t removed by the motion blur is further obscured by the swath of chroma noise (all the blue stuff that is randomly distributed everywhere) that is this image''s most dominant feature.  Finally...demestic?  You should look into installing the Firefox 2.0 web browser.  Its built in spell checker will never leave you spelling dOmestic wrong again! So, in summary, I''m giving you a 1.  Feel free to PM me (even during voting, I don''t really care) and I''ll gladly give you some pointers to remedy these mistakes for next time!', '2007-01-15 00:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
