(3233363, 453265, 20608, '<td valign="top">You are getting a 6 because it meets challenge, is in focus and nice composition (except those flag things) but MOST of all because you been together for 40 years SALUTE and enjoy another 40 together, you look great.</td>', 'You are getting a 6 because it meets challenge, is in focus and nice composition (except those flag things) but MOST of all because you been together for 40 years SALUTE and enjoy another 40 together, you look great.', '2007-01-15 03:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
