(3233601, 452614, 65886, '<td valign="top">what a funny shot:) ah, is it f1.4 you used here? it looks like this to me. I really like the effect, only some parts of the shoe in focus and the rest is blurred. the photo suggests a lot, but I like the form of a metaphor. I also like the composition and the colors:) the colors are great.</td>', 'what a funny shot:) ah, is it f1.4 you used here? it looks like this to me. I really like the effect, only some parts of the shoe in focus and the rest is blurred. the photo suggests a lot, but I like the form of a metaphor. I also like the composition and the colors:) the colors are great.', '2007-01-15 07:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3233648, 453141, 55837, '<td valign="top">Best image of the bunch.  If this is in-camera double exposure, then the alignment is perfect.</td>', 'Best image of the bunch.  If this is in-camera double exposure, then the alignment is perfect.', '2007-01-15 08:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
