(3233807, 453048, 12200, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite submissions. It''s not as well-executed as I think it could have been done (probably because of the glass being used), but the use of nude on this one is appropriate, and I love the perspective. Keep tweaking this idea, and I think you have something very special.</td>', 'This is one of my favorite submissions. It''s not as well-executed as I think it could have been done (probably because of the glass being used), but the use of nude on this one is appropriate, and I love the perspective. Keep tweaking this idea, and I think you have something very special.', '2007-01-15 08:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3233983, 453048, 13207, '<td valign="top">A little too dark and wish the glass were a little more obvious - took me a moment to even realize you were under glass!  Great concept though</td>', 'A little too dark and wish the glass were a little more obvious - took me a moment to even realize you were under glass!  Great concept though', '2007-01-15 09:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3233992, 451648, 28261, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge, however, lots of noise caused by flat lighting or underexposure.  The motion blur leaves almost nothing in focus, leading to an image that appears happenstance.<br/> <br/> ( 1 )</td>', 'Fits challenge, however, lots of noise caused by flat lighting or underexposure.  The motion blur leaves almost nothing in focus, leading to an image that appears happenstance.  ( 1 )', '2007-01-15 09:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
