(3234026, 449673, 28261, '<td valign="top">A snapshot quality image of a lion.  I see no relevance in the challenge.  This is a decent capture, but DNMC.<br/> <br/>( 1 )</td>', 'A snapshot quality image of a lion.  I see no relevance in the challenge.  This is a decent capture, but DNMC. ( 1 )', '2007-01-15 09:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234038, 452259, 28261, '<td valign="top">Image is snapshot quality. There are many blown highlights and the fencing creates a disturbing mess of distraction, leaving the people with very littel impact over all.  Against the white sky, this image loses interest quickly.<br/> <br/>( 2 )</td>', 'Image is snapshot quality. There are many blown highlights and the fencing creates a disturbing mess of distraction, leaving the people with very littel impact over all.  Against the white sky, this image loses interest quickly. ( 2 )', '2007-01-15 09:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234047, 450890, 28261, '<td valign="top">Image lighting is way too muddy.  Darkness upon darkness with a flash of light painting that is bold.  Unfortunately the expression is lost in the shadows and leaves me lacking a desire to come back to it.<br/> <br/>( 2 )</td>', 'Image lighting is way too muddy.  Darkness upon darkness with a flash of light painting that is bold.  Unfortunately the expression is lost in the shadows and leaves me lacking a desire to come back to it. ( 2 )', '2007-01-15 09:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234055, 452845, 28261, '<td valign="top">I like the expression here and the concept, however the skin tone is almost blown out while the dress is lost to shadows.  There is no middle ground here and leaves the image very unbalanced.  The pink color cast goes well with the glasses, but the image loses much in the dark vs light in the lower half.<br/> <br/>( 2 )</td>', 'I like the expression here and the concept, however the skin tone is almost blown out while the dress is lost to shadows.  There is no middle ground here and leaves the image very unbalanced.  The pink color cast goes well with the glasses, but the image loses much in the dark vs light in the lower half. ( 2 )', '2007-01-15 09:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234104, 453133, 28261, '<td valign="top">I find the workshop background, tape and plastic to be very ''shoddy'' in the concepts execution.  The major blow out is extremely distracting.  Overall does not appear a lot of thought or effort went into taking this, except to just take a photo.<br/> <br/>( 2 )</td>', 'I find the workshop background, tape and plastic to be very ''shoddy'' in the concepts execution.  The major blow out is extremely distracting.  Overall does not appear a lot of thought or effort went into taking this, except to just take a photo. ( 2 )', '2007-01-15 10:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234109, 452987, 28261, '<td valign="top">Great DOF, nice composure.  Poor choice of subject that is really not that interesting in lighting or coloration.  Not an image that I am drawn to.<br/> <br/>( 2 )</td>', 'Great DOF, nice composure.  Poor choice of subject that is really not that interesting in lighting or coloration.  Not an image that I am drawn to. ( 2 )', '2007-01-15 10:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234116, 453145, 28261, '<td valign="top">Common concept, not uniquely captured.  The image is ''dirty''.  Focus not true to the subject and a pink coloration overall that really takes away from the image.  The carpeting background leaves the image feeling shoddy.<br/> <br/>( 2 )</td>', 'Common concept, not uniquely captured.  The image is ''dirty''.  Focus not true to the subject and a pink coloration overall that really takes away from the image.  The carpeting background leaves the image feeling shoddy. ( 2 )', '2007-01-15 10:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234122, 453270, 67258, '<td valign="top">I''d have loved to be a fly on the wall in your household to watch the ''Battle of the Sexes'' Final when your other half discovered what you had done in the name of DPC!  Nice one...</td>', 'I''d have loved to be a fly on the wall in your household to watch the ''Battle of the Sexes'' Final when your other half discovered what you had done in the name of DPC!  Nice one...', '2007-01-15 10:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
