(3234559, 453035, 70000, '<td valign="top">There are so many toilet seats but with some you can actually see the battle in the picture but here it''s just a picture of a toilet, the battle depends completely on the title which weakens it a bit in my opinion.</td>', 'There are so many toilet seats but with some you can actually see the battle in the picture but here it''s just a picture of a toilet, the battle depends completely on the title which weakens it a bit in my opinion.', '2007-01-15 11:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234562, 453201, 70000, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and sharpness of this picture. It''s a unique idea however the light on her hand is kind of blown and it took me a while to be able to see her cigar because it was too dark. There is great color and lighting in this picture that''s just one picky thing from me hahaha.</td>', 'I really like the colors and sharpness of this picture. It''s a unique idea however the light on her hand is kind of blown and it took me a while to be able to see her cigar because it was too dark. There is great color and lighting in this picture that''s just one picky thing from me hahaha.', '2007-01-15 12:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234571, 453007, 28261, '<td valign="top">While a unique concept, the image itself appears oversharpened to the point that the colorations are distorted.  This would have done much much better in black/white.  The hair appears oof because of the finishing.<br/> <br/>( 4 )</td>', 'While a unique concept, the image itself appears oversharpened to the point that the colorations are distorted.  This would have done much much better in black/white.  The hair appears oof because of the finishing. ( 4 )', '2007-01-15 12:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234581, 452989, 36382, '<td valign="top">Good.  I''m not sure what they are fighting over though.  Now, if it were a tv remote ..... :)  OK i''ve voted a few more images and it seems the remote is a bit of a recurring theme.  You went for something different.  That''s good.</td>', 'Good.  I''m not sure what they are fighting over though.  Now, if it were a tv remote ..... :)  OK i''ve voted a few more images and it seems the remote is a bit of a recurring theme.  You went for something different.  That''s good.', '2007-01-15 12:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234585, 451597, 2490, '<td valign="top">Holy skidmarks!  That''s a rig.</td>', 'Holy skidmarks!  That''s a rig.', '2007-01-15 12:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234587, 451353, 17072, '<td valign="top">omg! its daddy dearest!!  Very nice, love the concept.</td>', 'omg! its daddy dearest!!  Very nice, love the concept.', '2007-01-15 12:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
