(3234625, 453048, 43031, '<td valign="top">Extremely raw and emotive, bumped up to a 10 because this one sticks with me, and really makes the idea travel beyond the photograph and into my soul. I''m not a fan of nudity, but the vulnerability here is astonishing, the high viewpoint reinforces that theme. Fabulous work, well done.</td>', 'Extremely raw and emotive, bumped up to a 10 because this one sticks with me, and really makes the idea travel beyond the photograph and into my soul. I''m not a fan of nudity, but the vulnerability here is astonishing, the high viewpoint reinforces that theme. Fabulous work, well done.', '2007-01-15 12:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234630, 453256, 66353, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and very well done...<br/>(even though I have to admit that my wife is better with maps than I am)<br/>:-)</td>', 'Excellent idea and very well done...(even though I have to admit that my wife is better with maps than I am):-)', '2007-01-15 12:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234632, 452989, 28261, '<td valign="top">Concept: Confusing translation to challenge subject.  Unique but not superbly executed...too much negative space, scene appears contrived/posed.<br/>Lighting:  Excellent use of elements here.  Nice color cast usage.<br/>Subjects feel ''cut off'' with the crop.  A subtle backlighting would have gone a long way in this image, helping the subject''s to not fall off into the shadow/background.<br/> <br/>( 5 )</td>', 'Concept: Confusing translation to challenge subject.  Unique but not superbly executed...too much negative space, scene appears contrived/posed.Lighting:  Excellent use of elements here.  Nice color cast usage.Subjects feel ''cut off'' with the crop.  A subtle backlighting would have gone a long way in this image, helping the subject''s to not fall off into the shadow/background. ( 5 )', '2007-01-15 12:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234644, 451321, 66353, '<td valign="top">Probably an American thing as well - I can''t see how this have anything to do with the challenge.</td>', 'Probably an American thing as well - I can''t see how this have anything to do with the challenge.', '2007-01-15 12:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234649, 452847, 28261, '<td valign="top">Concept: Does not translate well without title.<br/>Image Quality:  Excellent.  Nice finesse.  Lighting is flat over majority of image and really hurts the overall.  Could have used a slight rotation.<br/> <br/>( 5 )</td>', 'Concept: Does not translate well without title.Image Quality:  Excellent.  Nice finesse.  Lighting is flat over majority of image and really hurts the overall.  Could have used a slight rotation. ( 5 )', '2007-01-15 12:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234654, 450890, 69604, '<td valign="top">too dark</td>', 'too dark', '2007-01-15 12:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234655, 453265, 28261, '<td valign="top">The use of the gender flags really took away from the impact of this otherwise great image.  I loved the concept, expression and lighting.  A narrower crop and no flags would have resulted in a 7 at least.<br/> <br/>( 5 )</td>', 'The use of the gender flags really took away from the impact of this otherwise great image.  I loved the concept, expression and lighting.  A narrower crop and no flags would have resulted in a 7 at least. ( 5 )', '2007-01-15 12:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234672, 452627, 28261, '<td valign="top">A tough translation to the challenge, but given the doubt.  A good concept, well executed with DOF and crop - Noise levels in this image are really distracting and a pass with neat image would have raised the bar so to speak at least a point or two.<br/> <br/>( 5 )</td>', 'A tough translation to the challenge, but given the doubt.  A good concept, well executed with DOF and crop - Noise levels in this image are really distracting and a pass with neat image would have raised the bar so to speak at least a point or two. ( 5 )', '2007-01-15 12:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234678, 453236, 28261, '<td valign="top">I like this concept, but the lighting is flat on a profiled subject and thus the entire thing looks two-dimensional.  I love the finesse, sharp, even focus, good definition of color and tones. A light turn of the wrench one way or the other would have upped the finish on this one.<br/> <br/>( 5 )</td>', 'I like this concept, but the lighting is flat on a profiled subject and thus the entire thing looks two-dimensional.  I love the finesse, sharp, even focus, good definition of color and tones. A light turn of the wrench one way or the other would have upped the finish on this one. ( 5 )', '2007-01-15 12:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234686, 453146, 28261, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, muddied by vignetting and cacophany of negative space vs competitors.  Bit oversharpened (blades look jaggy).  Pink seems like it should have been more prominent in the image (closer crop, closer focal point?)<br/> <br/>( 5 )</td>', 'Interesting concept, muddied by vignetting and cacophany of negative space vs competitors.  Bit oversharpened (blades look jaggy).  Pink seems like it should have been more prominent in the image (closer crop, closer focal point?) ( 5 )', '2007-01-15 12:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234712, 451597, 67258, '<td valign="top">As a woman would say, it''s not the size that counts, it''s what you can do with it...   (and men will believe anything...)</td>', 'As a woman would say, it''s not the size that counts, it''s what you can do with it...   (and men will believe anything...)', '2007-01-15 12:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234819, 452343, 36382, '<td valign="top">This one stands out for me.  I''ll be really surprised if it doesn''t win blue.  You kept it simple but still interesting and concentrated on good lighting.  Excellent.</td>', 'This one stands out for me.  I''ll be really surprised if it doesn''t win blue.  You kept it simple but still interesting and concentrated on good lighting.  Excellent.', '2007-01-15 13:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
