(3234927, 453141, 28261, '<td valign="top">A disturbing image, very well executed and lit.  Perhaps a bit oversharpened, but practically perfect.  At least a 2nd place ribbon from me.<br/> <br/>( 9 )</td>', 'A disturbing image, very well executed and lit.  Perhaps a bit oversharpened, but practically perfect.  At least a 2nd place ribbon from me. ( 9 )', '2007-01-15 13:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
