(3235099, 452849, 28261, '<td valign="top">Disturbing!  :-)<br/>The grey tone leaves the image flat, but that is the only thing going wrong in this image.  It may be a direct result of the partial desat.  Nice expressions and pose, great concept.<br/> <br/>( 7 )</td>', 'Disturbing!  :-)The grey tone leaves the image flat, but that is the only thing going wrong in this image.  It may be a direct result of the partial desat.  Nice expressions and pose, great concept. ( 7 )', '2007-01-15 14:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
