(3235110, 452848, 28261, '<td valign="top">Dof is a bit low for this image (to me) and the lighting seems flat, not dynamic.  Overall a good image that has a tough translation to the challenge.<br/> <br/>( 6 )</td>', 'Dof is a bit low for this image (to me) and the lighting seems flat, not dynamic.  Overall a good image that has a tough translation to the challenge. ( 6 )', '2007-01-15 14:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
