(3243607, 453298, 4793, '<td valign="top">The commodes are getting lots of attention in this challenge, nice work</td>', 'The commodes are getting lots of attention in this challenge, nice work', '2007-01-17 00:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3243615, 451432, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2007-01-17 00:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3244537, 453302, 47316, '<td valign="top">Cute! Love the disgusted look on his face and her expression as well!</td>', 'Cute! Love the disgusted look on his face and her expression as well!', '2007-01-17 03:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3244540, 450890, 47316, '<td valign="top">I really don''t get how this has to do with battle of the sexes... unless it''s tring to say that women are crazy. As far as technicals, it''s much too dark.</td>', 'I really don''t get how this has to do with battle of the sexes... unless it''s tring to say that women are crazy. As far as technicals, it''s much too dark.', '2007-01-17 03:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3244545, 453166, 47316, '<td valign="top">One of the better entries I think. Original. I don''t know who looks worse, the girl stealing the wallet or the guy grabbing a big handful! LOL. <br/> <br/>Only problem I have is something seems a bit weird with the saturation... like the front hands are more saturated than the rest of their skin. I guess this is meant to draw attention? But to me it just looks odd.</td>', 'One of the better entries I think. Original. I don''t know who looks worse, the girl stealing the wallet or the guy grabbing a big handful! LOL.  Only problem I have is something seems a bit weird with the saturation... like the front hands are more saturated than the rest of their skin. I guess this is meant to draw attention? But to me it just looks odd.', '2007-01-17 03:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3244550, 451671, 47316, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. Though I think you could have done more as far as expression and pose. She seems as if she is about to stab him while he looks as though he''s posing for a portrait. They are all dressed up, think they should play the part! :)<br/> <br/>As far as technicals the photos seems a lacking in some clarity.</td>', 'Cute idea. Though I think you could have done more as far as expression and pose. She seems as if she is about to stab him while he looks as though he''s posing for a portrait. They are all dressed up, think they should play the part! :) As far as technicals the photos seems a lacking in some clarity.', '2007-01-17 03:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3244555, 453141, 47316, '<td valign="top">Great image. Bizarre but great! Certainly one of the better images in the challenge.</td>', 'Great image. Bizarre but great! Certainly one of the better images in the challenge.', '2007-01-17 03:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3244558, 452849, 48560, '<td valign="top">great clarity and strong tones. might have made the male model appear more guy-ish if he had kept some unshaven beard or something. just my thoughts. nice shot nonetheless. simple and effective.</td>', 'great clarity and strong tones. might have made the male model appear more guy-ish if he had kept some unshaven beard or something. just my thoughts. nice shot nonetheless. simple and effective.', '2007-01-17 03:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3244561, 452989, 47316, '<td valign="top">I''m not really understanding the idea you are going for. The green glow is a cool effect. Think this could do with more expression from the models... though what kind of expression would be more clear if I knew the story behind this.</td>', 'I''m not really understanding the idea you are going for. The green glow is a cool effect. Think this could do with more expression from the models... though what kind of expression would be more clear if I knew the story behind this.', '2007-01-17 03:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3244566, 452863, 48560, '<td valign="top">priceless! <br/>(do you think the guy''s gonna care if he''s taking a leak with or without the seat down? i think the gal''s gonna suffer from the guy''s bad aim, lol)<br/> <br/>this photo has creative merits. love it.</td>', 'priceless! (do you think the guy''s gonna care if he''s taking a leak with or without the seat down? i think the gal''s gonna suffer from the guy''s bad aim, lol) this photo has creative merits. love it.', '2007-01-17 03:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
