(3256824, 453298, 3032, '<td valign="top">Given that the average aiming capabilities of men when (sleep)drunk deviates by 70% I wouldn''t touch any part of that toilet with no finger!<br/>Cool idea.</td>', 'Given that the average aiming capabilities of men when (sleep)drunk deviates by 70% I wouldn''t touch any part of that toilet with no finger!Cool idea.', '2007-01-19 17:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256838, 453254, 3032, '<td valign="top">It puzzles me why not toiletmaker has come up with an hydraulic system coupled to a recogition system. When a bum is turned towards the toilet it should close the toiletseat, when someone approaches but doesn''t show bum it should open.....<br/>When someone misses the pot it should spit right back... :)</td>', 'It puzzles me why not toiletmaker has come up with an hydraulic system coupled to a recogition system. When a bum is turned towards the toilet it should close the toiletseat, when someone approaches but doesn''t show bum it should open.....When someone misses the pot it should spit right back... :)', '2007-01-19 18:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256843, 453211, 3032, '<td valign="top">Get a second remote and give it to her (do not show them you got the original). First they think the batteries are gone, 2nd they think it doesn''t work, third they think it''s them not understanding how it works..... By the time they figured out that you gave them a faulty remote, you should have enjoyed a couple of weeks troublefree football.</td>', 'Get a second remote and give it to her (do not show them you got the original). First they think the batteries are gone, 2nd they think it doesn''t work, third they think it''s them not understanding how it works..... By the time they figured out that you gave them a faulty remote, you should have enjoyed a couple of weeks troublefree football.', '2007-01-19 18:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256848, 452914, 3032, '<td valign="top">We can grow a beer belly, but I guess that''s not the same right? :)</td>', 'We can grow a beer belly, but I guess that''s not the same right? :)', '2007-01-19 18:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
