(3256890, 452863, 3032, '<td valign="top">The problem is... We men, we don''t really need to lift the seat. That''s just a social gesture. Tying up the seat will not work, it will only get you, the woman, a wet seat....<br/> <br/>Good idea nonetheless. :)</td>', 'The problem is... We men, we don''t really need to lift the seat. That''s just a social gesture. Tying up the seat will not work, it will only get you, the woman, a wet seat.... Good idea nonetheless. :)', '2007-01-19 18:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
