(3263123, 453220, 40580, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  Bad execution.  <br/> <br/>Why?  The lighting''s not too bad (I only see a shadow behind the bear).  I think what really get''s me is the imbalance of the lady''s hands and bear with the man''s hands and fishing reel.  <br/> <br/>Also, there''s just too much stuff in the picture.  Too many colors.  Maybe if it was black and white it wouldn''t be so busy.  <br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Nice concept.  Bad execution.   Why?  The lighting''s not too bad (I only see a shadow behind the bear).  I think what really get''s me is the imbalance of the lady''s hands and bear with the man''s hands and fishing reel.   Also, there''s just too much stuff in the picture.  Too many colors.  Maybe if it was black and white it wouldn''t be so busy.   Good luck.', '2007-01-21 18:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
