(3264648, 453048, 53316, '<td valign="top">43rd???? WHAT???  Geez.  I guess it was voted down for the nudity like you said.  This is an AMAZING image with such POWERFUL symbolism.  I do NOT agree that it would have been better with a suit.  The nudity emphasized the womanly aspect to this dillema.  And as for where the battle is, well maybe people just didn''t understand the phrase "glass ceiling".<br/> <br/>I''d say, put a nice plain black border at the bottom and have fancy-but-simple looking text saying "Glass Ceiling" there, and see how it sells.</td>', '43rd???? WHAT???  Geez.  I guess it was voted down for the nudity like you said.  This is an AMAZING image with such POWERFUL symbolism.  I do NOT agree that it would have been better with a suit.  The nudity emphasized the womanly aspect to this dillema.  And as for where the battle is, well maybe people just didn''t understand the phrase "glass ceiling". I''d say, put a nice plain black border at the bottom and have fancy-but-simple looking text saying "Glass Ceiling" there, and see how it sells.', '2007-01-22 01:18:10.000000', NULL, 0),
