(3265142, 453031, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>As always, you are a great photographer, Cindi!</b> <br/> <br/>IMHO, you are also a great philosopher/sociologist for you have depicted <i>the social transformation of the last half of the twentieth century</i> in the U.S. and most technologically advanced countries.<br/> <br/>This is <b>the light-hearted creativity</b> I have come to expect out of you, especially in areas that have the potential for volatility.  <i>Being quick-witted, humorous, and universally likable</i>, you defuse the situation by redirecting the potential-energy toward consistent high scores.<br/> <br/><b>Bottom Line:</b> <i>I gain wisdom when I watch &amp; learn.</i>  :)</td>', 'As always, you are a great photographer, Cindi!  IMHO, you are also a great philosopher/sociologist for you have depicted the social transformation of the last half of the twentieth century in the U.S. and most technologically advanced countries. This is the light-hearted creativity I have come to expect out of you, especially in areas that have the potential for volatility.  Being quick-witted, humorous, and universally likable, you defuse the situation by redirecting the potential-energy toward consistent high scores. Bottom Line: I gain wisdom when I watch & learn.  :)', '2007-01-22 05:24:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3265179, 453282, 50034, '<td valign="top"><i>"Mr. Ed, it''s been too long!  Where have you been?"</i> <br/> <br/>       True!  All that screaming does tend <i>to make one hoarse.</i>   :}  However, no real need to worry about this guy for I''m quite sure that <i>THIS is a stable relationship.</i>  :}<br/> <br/>Have a nice life!  (yawn)  I guess it''s about time for me to <i>"hit the hay."</i></td>', '"Mr. Ed, it''s been too long!  Where have you been?"         True!  All that screaming does tend to make one hoarse.   :}  However, no real need to worry about this guy for I''m quite sure that THIS is a stable relationship.  :} Have a nice life!  (yawn)  I guess it''s about time for me to "hit the hay."', '2007-01-22 05:42:51.000000', NULL, 0),
