(3265450, 453282, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I love how you manipulated the models into key positions within the frame and elicited such perfect expressions; good job with their makeup, too.  Mostly I''m amazed at how you hid all the lighting components - hard to do without cloning out major elements!  Seriously, an amazingly well seen, well captured photograph.  What really makes my day is it''s humorous, somewhat title dependent, and was still rewarded with a great score and placing.  I think that means it''s really, really good.</td>', 'Great shot!  I love how you manipulated the models into key positions within the frame and elicited such perfect expressions; good job with their makeup, too.  Mostly I''m amazed at how you hid all the lighting components - hard to do without cloning out major elements!  Seriously, an amazingly well seen, well captured photograph.  What really makes my day is it''s humorous, somewhat title dependent, and was still rewarded with a great score and placing.  I think that means it''s really, really good.', '2007-01-22 07:49:23.000000', NULL, 0),
