(3266034, 453145, 26669, '<td valign="top">hi,<br/>I think the focus could use a little work here, it is sharp on the right and soft on the left, i dont think this was the intent but i could be wrong. <br/> <br/>The skin tones do seem a little harsh as pointed out below  but you had a good idea just the execution needs a little work. <br/> <br/></td>', 'hi,I think the focus could use a little work here, it is sharp on the right and soft on the left, i dont think this was the intent but i could be wrong.  The skin tones do seem a little harsh as pointed out below  but you had a good idea just the execution needs a little work.  ', '2007-01-22 10:46:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3266042, 451648, 64918, '<td valign="top">Hmmm  thought you got a bit of a pasting here for daring to do something a little different  the noise and deliberate blur work well for me however I think a more dynamic shooting position would improve the composition, this is a little too in profile to really emphasise the idea of action, and a brighter colour in there somewhere, say a bright red top for the lady, too give it a little (metaphorical) punch!<br/>Dont be afraid to submit works that are a little outside the box for DPC though  work on your style  originality is rarely fully appreciated in its infancy.</td>', 'Hmmm  thought you got a bit of a pasting here for daring to do something a little different  the noise and deliberate blur work well for me however I think a more dynamic shooting position would improve the composition, this is a little too in profile to really emphasise the idea of action, and a brighter colour in there somewhere, say a bright red top for the lady, too give it a little (metaphorical) punch!Dont be afraid to submit works that are a little outside the box for DPC though  work on your style  originality is rarely fully appreciated in its infancy.', '2007-01-22 10:50:02.000000', NULL, 0),
