(3266510, 453224, 62637, '<td valign="top">Unfortunate that this one wasn''t understood.  I would imagine that it was the younger voters that misinterpreted the concept, as birth control is something that people my age take for granted.  The effect on gender relations of cheap, accessible, and reliable birth control isn''t something you learn in your average high school classroom.<br/> <br/>Anyways, I got it, should have been top 10 IMO...</td>', 'Unfortunate that this one wasn''t understood.  I would imagine that it was the younger voters that misinterpreted the concept, as birth control is something that people my age take for granted.  The effect on gender relations of cheap, accessible, and reliable birth control isn''t something you learn in your average high school classroom. Anyways, I got it, should have been top 10 IMO...', '2007-01-22 12:40:55.000000', NULL, 0),
