(3266516, 453141, 20462, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MAK:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>Oh dear.... When did this happen? I thought anything IN CAMERA was fine.<br/> <br/></i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I pm''d SC a couple of weeks ago and they said the rule "create your entry from a single capture" takes precedence over the "you may" section of anything in camera.  I had a similar idea and since I am a new D200 owner was looking forward to this feature as well.  Bummer.</td>', 'Originally posted by MAK: Oh dear.... When did this happen? I thought anything IN CAMERA was fine.   I pm''d SC a couple of weeks ago and they said the rule "create your entry from a single capture" takes precedence over the "you may" section of anything in camera.  I had a similar idea and since I am a new D200 owner was looking forward to this feature as well.  Bummer.', '2007-01-22 12:42:30.000000', NULL, 0),
