(3267831, 453133, 57229, '<td valign="top">Thanks for commenting here, Darren. It''s not easy to say something about efforts that remind of nothing more than a thin soup of shite.<br/> <br/>It is altogether too hastily thrown together. The idea was to provide something conceptual, with the red void in between the two surfaces representing the ''battle of the sexes''. (Said battle is, of itself, mostly conceptual, I think). More blood and gore and more contrast in the battle zone might have helped a tad.<br/> <br/>I don''t know if you do any gardening, but it''s often useful rule of thumb to say ''you don''t nurse sick plants''. I think this one''s for the compost. I very much appreciate your taking time on it though, thanks.</td>', 'Thanks for commenting here, Darren. It''s not easy to say something about efforts that remind of nothing more than a thin soup of shite. It is altogether too hastily thrown together. The idea was to provide something conceptual, with the red void in between the two surfaces representing the ''battle of the sexes''. (Said battle is, of itself, mostly conceptual, I think). More blood and gore and more contrast in the battle zone might have helped a tad. I don''t know if you do any gardening, but it''s often useful rule of thumb to say ''you don''t nurse sick plants''. I think this one''s for the compost. I very much appreciate your taking time on it though, thanks.', '2007-01-22 17:30:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3267904, 452614, 19672, '<td valign="top">Need pointier stiletto heels...<br/> <br/>;-)</td>', 'Need pointier stiletto heels... ;-)', '2007-01-22 17:47:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3267907, 453141, 36328, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Cutter:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MAK:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>Oh dear.... When did this happen? I thought anything IN CAMERA was fine.<br/> <br/></i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I pm''d SC a couple of weeks ago and they said the rule "create your entry from a single capture" takes precedence over the "you may" section of anything in camera.  I had a similar idea and since I am a new D200 owner was looking forward to this feature as well.  Bummer. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>MAK - Thought this was validated during voting? I saw the ''This image has been validated'' at the time. <br/> <br/>I knew this was yours, and is excellent. I gave this the highest of the lot - shame you missed the blue again!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-22 17:49:35.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Cutter: Originally posted by MAK: Oh dear.... When did this happen? I thought anything IN CAMERA was fine.   I pm''d SC a couple of weeks ago and they said the rule "create your entry from a single capture" takes precedence over the "you may" section of anything in camera.  I had a similar idea and since I am a new D200 owner was looking forward to this feature as well.  Bummer.   MAK - Thought this was validated during voting? I saw the ''This image has been validated'' at the time.  I knew this was yours, and is excellent. I gave this the highest of the lot - shame you missed the blue again!', '2007-01-22 17:49:03.000000', '2007-01-22 17:49:35.000000', 0),
