(3268045, 453141, 20608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PurpleFire:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>MAK - Thought this was validated during voting? I saw the ''This image has been validated'' at the time. <br/> <br/>I knew this was yours, and is excellent. I gave this the highest of the lot - shame you missed the blue again! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks mate YES it has been validated and was validated during the challenge. I am happy to get the second ribbon I just hope my luck can hold out longer so I can maybe get another soon.</td>', 'Originally posted by PurpleFire: MAK - Thought this was validated during voting? I saw the ''This image has been validated'' at the time.  I knew this was yours, and is excellent. I gave this the highest of the lot - shame you missed the blue again!   Thanks mate YES it has been validated and was validated during the challenge. I am happy to get the second ribbon I just hope my luck can hold out longer so I can maybe get another soon.', '2007-01-22 18:30:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3268112, 452343, 45194, '<td valign="top">Ok, the amount of congratulations is embarrassing! Enough already! LOL.  Yeah, it feels pretty good to finally ribbon.  Took me over a year to do it but hopefully it won''t take another year to get my second.  I''m already trying to plan my next shoot.  So much pressure now. Thanks again to everyone who commented before and after. This proves you don''t have to take a picture of something controversial in order to get comments. :)</td>', 'Ok, the amount of congratulations is embarrassing! Enough already! LOL.  Yeah, it feels pretty good to finally ribbon.  Took me over a year to do it but hopefully it won''t take another year to get my second.  I''m already trying to plan my next shoot.  So much pressure now. Thanks again to everyone who commented before and after. This proves you don''t have to take a picture of something controversial in order to get comments. :)', '2007-01-22 18:53:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3268222, 453025, 25678, '<td valign="top">Great lighting in this!</td>', 'Great lighting in this!', '2007-01-22 19:27:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3268335, 452614, 39702, '<td valign="top">This photo surely fits the challenge :)  The title is appropriate to say the least.  I think the short DOF might have hurt you a bit, especially as it applies to the bottom right corner and the sharpness of the hotdog on the left side.  I think the focus might have been on the back of the shoe and not the heel/hotdog as well.  The back of the shoe is tack sharp whereas the action point where the heel meets the hotdog is a tad soft (though it could be my monitor). The transition from the hotdog to the shoe on the right side is halo''d and the colors were affected adversely by sharpening if I''m guessing correctly.   I think the composition was quite nice.</td>', 'This photo surely fits the challenge :)  The title is appropriate to say the least.  I think the short DOF might have hurt you a bit, especially as it applies to the bottom right corner and the sharpness of the hotdog on the left side.  I think the focus might have been on the back of the shoe and not the heel/hotdog as well.  The back of the shoe is tack sharp whereas the action point where the heel meets the hotdog is a tad soft (though it could be my monitor). The transition from the hotdog to the shoe on the right side is halo''d and the colors were affected adversely by sharpening if I''m guessing correctly.   I think the composition was quite nice.', '2007-01-22 20:03:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3268590, 452614, 68388, '<td valign="top">I had fun making this photo, I laughed all the way through.<br/>I''m glad some of you enjoyed it.</td>', 'I had fun making this photo, I laughed all the way through.I''m glad some of you enjoyed it.', '2007-01-22 21:17:38.000000', NULL, 0),
