(3270138, 453133, 66597, '<td valign="top">Raish,<br/>I thought the concept was quite clever, actually. I gave it a 6. The blown highlight no doubt hurt you, and I agree with Darren that it has the appearance of being thrown together rather quickly. Still found it an interesting entry - and I''m not adverse to giving out 2''s or 3''s at times, so a 6 is not my "bad" score.</td>', 'Raish,I thought the concept was quite clever, actually. I gave it a 6. The blown highlight no doubt hurt you, and I agree with Darren that it has the appearance of being thrown together rather quickly. Still found it an interesting entry - and I''m not adverse to giving out 2''s or 3''s at times, so a 6 is not my "bad" score.', '2007-01-23 07:54:16.000000', NULL, 0),
