(3283725, 453141, 30861, '<td valign="top">Marac, this image has it all. It succeeds at a level far beyond the usual DPC "look", conveying its message with incredible intensity. You''ve transcended the challenge and created "art" using the theme as a springboard. For what it''s worth, I have no quarrel with the double-exposure issue; I''m well aware of how much work went into making this one work :-)</td>', 'Marac, this image has it all. It succeeds at a level far beyond the usual DPC "look", conveying its message with incredible intensity. You''ve transcended the challenge and created "art" using the theme as a springboard. For what it''s worth, I have no quarrel with the double-exposure issue; I''m well aware of how much work went into making this one work :-)', '2007-01-26 00:25:58.000000', NULL, 0),
