(3283769, 453256, 30861, '<td valign="top">Technically this is simply excellent, a real tour-de-force. It''s also a very amusing take on a universally recognized battlefield of the war between the sexes, so it''s not surprise you got a high finish. In fact, I had it in my personal top 3. Good job!</td>', 'Technically this is simply excellent, a real tour-de-force. It''s also a very amusing take on a universally recognized battlefield of the war between the sexes, so it''s not surprise you got a high finish. In fact, I had it in my personal top 3. Good job!', '2007-01-26 00:31:02.000000', NULL, 0),
