(3296923, 453304, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by suemack:</b></div><hr/><i> Praps you should have painted one pink and t''other one blue so people could tell the difference! Highly undervalued contender to this challenge! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>LOL - believe me, I thought about it. But as I said, it was a 12 minute job &amp; probably got better than it deserved for lack of preparation &amp; effort. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by suemack: Praps you should have painted one pink and t''other one blue so people could tell the difference! Highly undervalued contender to this challenge!  LOL - believe me, I thought about it. But as I said, it was a 12 minute job & probably got better than it deserved for lack of preparation & effort. :)', '2007-01-29 03:53:39.000000', NULL, 0),
